Welcome to FWD HK eServices! This is a services app, dedicated to corporate employees. Now you can enjoy the convenience to manage and access information of your FWD insurance policies via this user-friendly platform. 

Key features include: 
•	access the benefit schedule and online forms anytime, anywhere;
•	search for location and contact details of nearby panel doctors quickly; 
•	submit group medical insurance claims via online claims form. E-claims application can be completed in a matter of minutes;
•	keep you posted of claims status and settlement details via app’s push notification and email; and 
•	many more information…
